&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:10.5pt;"&gt;(重要な後発事象)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:15pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantEventsAfterReportingPeriodFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
